# Phone CLI — Core Invariants

- ALWAYS `thiserror` domain enums — NEVER `anyhow` in modules.
- ALWAYS `./validate.sh` (fmt + clippy `-D warnings` + nextest/test).
- NEVER `unsafe` unless the user explicitly asks.
- ALWAYS inject `CommandRunner` / `Wait` at the shell (`main`) boundary.
